Package: weatherglass
Version: 0.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCHITECTURE
Maintainer: Weatherglass contributors <weatherglass@example.invalid>
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.18), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.6), ca-certificates
Description: Native weather forecast and animated radar
 Native GTK 4 weather application with Open-Meteo forecasts, saved locations,
 offline cache, configurable units, animated radar, and optional WeatherKit.
